1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,102
Mega quiz time! Who is this shadow?

2
00:00:03,502 --> 00:00:06,259
It has big floppy ears and a long, long trunk!

3
00:00:10,059 --> 00:00:11,483
Yes! It's an elephant!

4
00:00:11,983 --> 00:00:13,606
Say it with me! Elephant!

5
