Who is this tiny shadow?

6
00:00:18,668 --> 00:00:20,826
It is little and red with black spots!

7
00:00:24,626 --> 00:00:26,109
Yes! It's a ladybug!

8
00:00:26,609 --> 00:00:28,332
Say it with me! Ladybug!

9
00:00:31,632 --> 00:00:32,704
What is this shadow?

10
00:00:33,104 --> 00:00:35,660
Three, two, one... it zooms up to space!

11
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:40,854
Yes! It's a rocket!

12
00:00:41,354 --> 00:00:43,024
Say it with me! Rocket!

13
00:00:46,324 --> 00:00:47,388
Who is this shadow?

14
00:00:47,788 --> 00:00:50,280
It lives in the sea and loves to jump and splash!

15
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:55,505
Yes! It's a dolphin!

16
00:00:56,005 --> 00:00:57,592
Say it with me! Dolphin!

17
00:01:00,892 --> 00:01:01,964
What is this shadow?

18
00:01:02,364 --> 00:01:05,194
