19
00:01:08,994 --> 00:01:10,194
Yes! It's a coat!

20
00:01:10,694 --> 00:01:12,004
Say it with me! Coat!

21
00:01:15,304 --> 00:01:17,054
Last one! Who is this shadow?

22
00:01:17,454 --> 00:01:20,212
It has humps on its back and walks in the hot desert!

23
00:01:24,012 --> 00:01:25,288
Yes! It's a camel!

24
00:01:25,788 --> 00:01:27,260
Say it with me! Camel!

25
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:33,342
Wow! You finished the mega quiz! How many did you guess?

